<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent" />
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="NeonArc Games" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#050814" />
    <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />
    <title>NeonArc Games</title>
    <style>
      @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%, rgba(110, 243, 255, 0.08), transparent 30%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 80% 60%, rgba(255, 110, 230, 0.12), transparent 30%),
          #030712;
        color: #e8f6ff;
      }
      header {
        padding: 28px clamp(18px, 4vw, 48px);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .brand {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
      }
      .brand h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      }
      .brand p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #9eb4d6;
      }
      nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .pill {
        border: 1px solid rgba(110, 243, 255, 0.35);
        background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(110, 243, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 110, 230, 0.08));
        color: #e8f6ff;
        padding: 10px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
      }
      .pill:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        border-color: rgba(110, 243, 255, 0.65);
      }
      main {
        padding: 10px clamp(18px, 4vw, 48px) 48px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 24px;
      }
      .hero {
        display: grid;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px);
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(110, 243, 255, 0.2);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8, 18, 32, 0.9), rgba(6, 10, 24, 0.92));
        box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      }
      .hero h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(26px, 5vw, 34px);
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      }
      .hero p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #c1d4f4;
      }
      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
      }
      .card-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .card {
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      }
      .card h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      .card p {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: #c7d6f0;
      }
      footer {
        padding: 18px clamp(18px, 4vw, 48px) 32px;
        color: #9eb4d6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <h1>NeonArc Games</h1>
        <p>Precision-built game loops, glowing challenges, and a shared credit ledger.</p>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a class="pill" href="/login">Login</a>
        <a class="pill" href="/register">Register</a>
        <a class="pill" href="/app">Enter the Neon Lobby</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h2>Welcome to the NeonArc Games lobby.</h2>
        <p>
          Experience a constellation of original skill and card titles driven by glowing credits,
          daily prizes, and community challenges. Spin the wheel, lock in a mission, and outfit a
          custom avatar before you play.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="pill" href="/app">Play the live games</a>
          <a class="pill" href="/register">Create an account</a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="card-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Daily Prizes</h3>
          <p>Spin the NeonArc wheel each day for credits, boosts, and surprise drops.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Challenges</h3>
          <p>Quick missions track your wins, push you toward badges, and reward bonus credits.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Avatars & Gear</h3>
          <p>Spend credits on animated avatars, table themes, and synth badges inside the shop.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>Need a custom setup? <a class="pill" href="mailto:neonarcgames@outlook.com">Contact support</a> and we will craft your NeonArc Games lobby.</footer>
  </body>
</html>
